E_ALREADY_EXISTS	AlreadyExists	A resource with the same unique key already exists.	Choose a different name, or fetch the existing resource instead of creating a new one.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapStateError (state.ErrAlreadyExists; producer restored in the 2026-10-01 batch-0 review after the REST 409 regression)
E_CHANGE_FROZEN	FailedPrecondition	A change freeze is active for the team owning this resource; the change verb is refused with the freeze reason.	Read-only and stop verbs stay available during the freeze. An operator lifts it with 'fleetly freeze lift <id>' (the freeze_id context names the row).	internal/governance/freeze.go (ADR-0017 appendix A.3: team-scoped change freeze, tsuru Block semantics)
E_CONFLICT	FailedPrecondition	The operation conflicts with the resource's current state.	Resolve the conflicting state named in the cause (cancel or wait for active work, remove referencing resources, or refresh after a concurrent change) and retry.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapStateError (state.ErrConflict: CAS mismatch / FK RESTRICT); structure.go DeleteApp/DeleteProject (ADR-0023); REST maps 409 via assembly errcodeToHTTP
E_EVENTS_GONE	FailedPrecondition	The requested event cursor is older than the earliest retained event (the retention window trimmed it).	Resynchronize: re-read the current state of the resources you track (list endpoints), then continue from the last_seq reported by GetEventStatus.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/contexts.go EventsService (ADR-0026: retention window + 410 + snapshot resync)
E_FORBIDDEN	PermissionDenied	The token lacks the scope required by this method.	Use a token whose role grants the required resource:action scope, or ask an admin for one.	internal/authn/interceptor.go guard (scopeSet.Satisfies)
E_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT	AlreadyExists	The Idempotency-Key is already used by a different or in-progress request, or conflicts with the request's own idempotency_key field.	Use a fresh key for each new request. A completed response replays for 24h under the same key and the same request body; an in-progress request returns this conflict until it completes.	internal/idem/enforcer.go (ADR-0024: header form, single table, interceptor enforcement)
E_INTERNAL	Internal	Internal server error.	Check fleetlyd logs for the matching error_id. If the error persists, report it with the error_id attached.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapStateError (fallback)
E_INVALID_ARGUMENT	InvalidArgument	The request payload is invalid.	Fix the flagged field and retry. Field paths point at the exact input location.	internal/spec spec.ValidationError → internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapValidationError
E_INVALID_INVITATION	PermissionDenied	The invitation token is invalid, already used, or expired.	Ask an admin for a fresh invitation; invitation tokens are single-use and time-boxed.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/invitations.go AcceptInvitation
E_INVALID_SIGNATURE	Unauthenticated	The webhook signature verification failed.	Ensure the GitHub webhook secret matches the hook secret shown once by 'fleetly hooks set/rotate' (rotate the hook and update GitHub if the secret is lost).	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/webhook.go ReceiveWebhook
E_NOT_CANCELLABLE	FailedPrecondition	The deployment has reached a terminal state and can no longer be cancelled.	Terminal states are facts, not actions; deploy a new revision instead.	internal/engine/admission.go Cancel
E_NOT_FOUND	NotFound	The requested resource does not exist.	Check the resource id and list existing resources to confirm the target.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/mapping.go mapStateError
E_NO_BASELINE	FailedPrecondition	The app has no successful deployment to roll back to.	Deploy at least one revision successfully before rolling back.	internal/engine/rollback.go Rollback
E_PLATFORM_BACKUP_FAILED	FailedPrecondition	The platform backup chain failed or is unavailable (restic missing, platform backup not configured, or the restic run failed).	Install the pinned restic version and retry; a failed platform backup is a hard stop for the upgrade sequence (ADR-0015: backup precedes the swap). The platform.backup_failed event carries the chain detail.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/platform.go TriggerPlatformBackup/ListPlatformBackups (ADR-0039 decision 10; F2.3 upgrade precondition)
E_QUEUE_FULL	ResourceExhausted	The deployment admission queue is full for this app.	Retry after in-flight deployments finish, or cancel a queued deployment to free a slot.	internal/engine/admission.go Submit (ADR-0016)
E_QUOTA_EXCEEDED	ResourceExhausted	A project-level quota has been reached.	Remove unused entries of the quoted resource, or split the workload across projects.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/acceptance.go taskQuota/appQuota; structure.go configQuota (F0.17) / PutConfig
E_RATE_LIMITED	ResourceExhausted	The token has exhausted its create-request budget for the current rate window.	Retry after retry_after_seconds (REST also carries Retry-After). Idempotent replays do not consume budget: reuse the same Idempotency-Key to safely re-fetch a completed response.	internal/governance/ratelimit.go (ADR-0017 appendix A.2: per-token fixed window, in-memory, single-process control plane)
E_SECRET_UNAVAILABLE	FailedPrecondition	The secret facility is unavailable or the referenced secret is missing.	Create the missing secret or restore the master key under the data root keys/ directory.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/structure.go PutSecret / resolveMaterials
E_UNAUTHENTICATED	Unauthenticated	The request carries no valid token.	Log in with a valid token ('fleetly login'), or check that the token has not been revoked.	internal/authn/interceptor.go guard
E_UPLOAD_TOO_LARGE	ResourceExhausted	The uploaded source exceeds the per-upload size limit.	Exclude build-irrelevant files from the directory (e.g. .git), or build from a git reference instead.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/uploads.go UploadSource (ADR-0019 appendix A.3: streaming byte budget, 512MiB default)
E_UPLOAD_UNAVAILABLE	FailedPrecondition	The uploaded source referenced by this deploy no longer has its blob on disk.	The upload was likely affected by a retention sweep or a data-root migration; upload the source again and redeploy.	internal/api/fleetlygrpc/delivery.go Deploy (ADR-0019 appendix A.5)
